 "category": "image",
 "summary": "Small, fast single-window image viewer from Japan that pages through a folder, with manga mode and simple edits. Built-in formats are BMP, GIF, JPEG and PNG; everything else, archives included, comes through Susie plug-ins. Topped Vector's graphics-viewer download ranking five years running but has not changed since 2013.",
 "where_it_wins": [
  "Tiny and very light on old hardware",
  "Basic image edits and save (levels, colour, crop, resize)",
  "Move/copy to preset folders with one key",
  "Familiar to long-time Japanese Windows users"
 ],
 "where_schnellbild_wins": [
  "Native on Mac, maintained",
  "Thumbnail grid, list view and recursive search",
  "Modern formats (HEIC, AVIF, JPEG XL, RAW) without plug-ins",
  "Videos and archives built in",
  "Interface in 20 languages (MassiGra: Japanese only)"
 ],
